values
  ('mat-01', 'matrix', 1, -1.8, 0.2, 3, 25, 1, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure complète la grille ?', null, '{"type":"grid","gridSize":3,"cells":[{"id":"mat-01-c0","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":1}]},{"id":"mat-01-c1","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":2}]},{"id":"mat-01-c2","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":3}]},{"id":"mat-01-c3","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":2}]},{"id":"mat-01-c4","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":3}]},{"id":"mat-01-c5","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":4}]},{"id":"mat-01-c6","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":3}]},{"id":"mat-01-c7","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":4}]},{"id":"mat-01-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"mat-01-o0","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":2}]},{"id":"mat-01-o1","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":3}]},{"id":"mat-01-o2","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":4}]},{"id":"mat-01-o3","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":5}]},{"id":"mat-01-o4","shapes":[{"type":"dots","count":1}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Le nombre de points augmente de 1 vers la droite et de 1 vers le bas. La case manquante en compte 5.', '["Première ligne : 1, 2, 3 points.","Deuxième ligne : 2, 3, 4 — chaque ligne commence un cran plus haut.","Troisième ligne : 3, 4, donc 5."]'::jsonb),
  ('mat-02', 'matrix', 1, -1.8, 0.2, 1, 25, 1, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure complète la grille ?', null, '{"type":"grid","gridSize":3,"cells":[{"id":"mat-02-c0","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":1,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c1","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":2,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c2","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c3","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":2,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c4","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c5","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c6","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-c7","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"mat-02-o0","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-o1","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":5,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-o2","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-o3","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":2,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-02-o4","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":1,"fill":"transparent"}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Le cercle grandit d''un cran vers la droite et d''un cran vers le bas. La case manquante contient le plus grand cercle.', '["Chaque ligne agrandit le cercle de gauche à droite.","Chaque colonne fait de même de haut en bas.","La dernière case cumule les deux progressions."]'::jsonb),
