  ('mat-05', 'matrix', 1, -1.8, 0.2, 1, 30, 1, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure complète la grille ?', null, '{"type":"grid","gridSize":3,"cells":[{"id":"mat-05-c0","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c1","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"currentColor"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c2","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c3","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"currentColor"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c4","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c5","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"currentColor"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c6","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-05-c7","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"currentColor"}]},{"id":"mat-05-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"mat-05-o0","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"currentColor"}]},{"id":"mat-05-o1","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-05-o2","shapes":[{"type":"square","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-05-o3","shapes":[{"type":"square","size":3,"fill":"currentColor"}]},{"id":"mat-05-o4","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Le remplissage alterne d''une case à l''autre. La huitième case est pleine, la neuvième est donc vide.', '["En lisant de gauche à droite et de haut en bas, plein et vide se succèdent.","La case 8 est pleine, la case 9 est vide."]'::jsonb),
