  ('mat-07', 'matrix', 1, -0.9, 0.2, 2, 40, 2, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure complète la grille ?', null, '{"type":"grid","gridSize":3,"cells":[{"id":"mat-07-c0","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":2,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c1","shapes":[{"type":"square","size":2,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c2","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","size":2,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c3","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c4","shapes":[{"type":"square","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c5","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c6","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-c7","shapes":[{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"mat-07-o0","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","size":3,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-o1","shapes":[{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-o2","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-o3","shapes":[{"type":"circle","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"mat-07-o4","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","size":5,"fill":"transparent"}]}]}'::jsonb, 'La colonne fixe la forme, la ligne fixe la taille. Il faut un triangle de la taille de la dernière ligne.', '["Colonne 3 : toujours un triangle.","Ligne 3 : toujours la plus grande taille.","La case manquante croise les deux : grand triangle."]'::jsonb),
