  ('spa-22', 'spatial', 1, 1.8, 0.2, 0, 82, 5, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure poursuit la série ?', null, '{"type":"sequence","gridSize":2,"cells":[{"id":"spa-22-c0","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":0,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":1}]},{"id":"spa-22-c1","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":30,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":2}]},{"id":"spa-22-c2","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":60,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":3}]},{"id":"spa-22-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"spa-22-o0","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":90,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":4}]},{"id":"spa-22-o1","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":90,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":3}]},{"id":"spa-22-o2","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":60,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":4}]},{"id":"spa-22-o3","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":120,"size":5,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":4}]},{"id":"spa-22-o4","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":90,"size":4,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"dots","count":4}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Le triangle pivote de 30° sans changer de taille, pendant que le nombre de points augmente de 1.', '["Rotation : 0°, 30°, 60°, donc 90°.","Points : 1, 2, 3, donc 4.","La taille du triangle est constante : la proposition plus petite est écartée."]'::jsonb),
  ('spa-23', 'spatial', 1, 1.8, 0.2, 3, 78, 5, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure poursuit la série ?', null, '{"type":"sequence","gridSize":2,"cells":[{"id":"spa-23-c0","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":1,"rotation":150,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-c1","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":2,"rotation":120,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-c2","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":3,"rotation":90,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"spa-23-o0","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":4,"rotation":90,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-o1","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":3,"rotation":60,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-o2","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":5,"rotation":60,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-o3","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":4,"rotation":60,"size":2}]},{"id":"spa-23-o4","shapes":[{"type":"line","count":4,"rotation":120,"size":2}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Les traits se multiplient d''une unité pendant que la rotation recule de 30°.', '["Traits : 1, 2, 3, donc 4.","Rotation : 150°, 120°, 90°, donc 60°.","Cinq traits correspondrait à une étape de plus."]'::jsonb),
  ('spa-24', 'spatial', 1, 1.8, 0.2, 2, 90, 5, 'design-1', 'Quelle figure poursuit la série ?', null, '{"type":"sequence","gridSize":2,"cells":[{"id":"spa-24-c0","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":0,"size":1,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-c1","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":30,"size":2,"fill":"currentColor"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-c2","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":60,"size":3,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-q","shapes":[],"text":"?"}],"options":[{"id":"spa-24-o0","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":90,"size":4,"fill":"transparent"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-o1","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":90,"size":3,"fill":"currentColor"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-o2","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":90,"size":4,"fill":"currentColor"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-o3","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":60,"size":4,"fill":"currentColor"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]},{"id":"spa-24-o4","shapes":[{"type":"triangle","rotation":120,"size":4,"fill":"currentColor"},{"type":"square","size":4,"fill":"transparent"}]}]}'::jsonb, 'Trois règles simultanées : le triangle pivote de 30°, grandit d''un cran, et son remplissage alterne. Le cadre ne change jamais.', '["Rotation : 0°, 30°, 60°, donc 90°.","Taille : 1, 2, 3, donc 4.","Remplissage : vide, plein, vide, donc plein.","Le carré extérieur est constant : il ne porte aucune règle."]'::jsonb),
  ('mem-01', 'memory', 1, -1.8, 0.2, 2, 25, 1, 'design-1', 'Partez de 12. Ajoutez 5, puis retirez 3. Quel nombre obtenez-vous ?', '["12","13","14","15","17"]'::jsonb, null, '12 + 5 = 17, puis 17 − 3 = 14.', '["Première opération : 12 + 5 = 17.","Seconde opération : 17 − 3 = 14."]'::jsonb),
  ('mem-02', 'memory', 1, -1.8, 0.2, 1, 28, 1, 'design-1', 'Quelle lettre se trouve trois rangs après le F dans l''alphabet ?', '["H","I","J","K","G"]'::jsonb, null, 'Après F viennent G, H, puis I. La troisième est I.', '["G est au premier rang après F.","H au deuxième, I au troisième."]'::jsonb),
  ('mem-03', 'memory', 1, -1.8, 0.2, 1, 25, 1, 'design-1', 'Série : 2 - 7 - 5.

